  "sourceTitle": "Italian Pizza Dough",
  "sourceText": "Italian Pizza Dough\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 3:53pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups oil\n4 cups warm water\n5 pounds flour\n1/2 block of cake yeast\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Dissolve yeast in warm water. Add oil to flour and blend thoroughly. Add water to flour mixture and knead until smooth. Make dough for 8 large pizzas. Can be frozen and used at your convenience.",
